c":"gallery-assets/img/00/00e41a4cb0d792d9de8b.webp","file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:TamagotchiParadiseKeychainPlushes.jpg","caption":"Брелок плюшевый"},{"src":"gallery-assets/img/fe/fe389956672b2d1d63c2.webp","file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:TamagotchiChocoBoxCharms.png","caption":"Шарм Шокобокс"},{"src":"gallery-assets/img/3a/3adf0d77b7239714a95b.webp","file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:TamagotchiParadise_BathbombHairties.jpg","caption":"Заколки-бомбы"},{"src":"gallery-assets/img/32/32b1b61fde1bee2cba79.webp","file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:TamagotchiDieCutStickersSet3_Paradise.png","caption":"Tamagotchi Набор наклеек для высечки"},{"src":"gallery-assets/img/f0/f037739a3a42232a4571.webp","file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:JinsXTamagotchi_Promo.jpg","caption":"Jins Glasses X Tamagotchi очки"},{"src":"gallery-assets/img/f4/f47cacfea0e9ad406d03.webp","file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Lab_File_Item_Animation_Horhotchi_Sprite.png","caption":"Анимация элемента лабораторного файла при участии Horhotchi (Uni)","sprite":true},{"src":"gallery-assets/img/f7/f75763dfed88bf57ee0f.webp","file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:HorhotchiWing_Paradise_sprite.png","caption":"Аксессуар Planet Deco \"Horhotchi Крыло\" (Рай)","sprite":true},{"src":"gallery-assets/img/1a/1a062a355fbba4e30734.webp","file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:HorhotchiPlush_Paradise_sprite.png","caption":"Аксессуар \"Horhotchi Плюшевый\" Planet Deco (Рай)","sprite":true},{"src":"gallery-assets/img/a5/a5e34c79f7f74633ec30.webp","file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Horhotchi_small_sprite.png","caption":"Вид на поле (Рай; версия земли, воды и неба)","sprite":true},{"src":"gallery-assets/img/4e/4e0b2f526227c9fdac7f.webp","file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Horhotchi_Paradise_sprite.png","caption":"Спрайт крупным планом · Tamagotchi Paradise","sprite":true},{"src":"gallery-assets/img/bf/bf